    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Mendeleev's Periodic Table was based on atomic mass, whereas the Modern Periodic Table is based on atomic number.",
        "Atomic radius decreases across a period from left to right and increases down a group.",
        "Electronegativity and ionization energy increase across a period and decrease down a group."
      ],
